{"parse": {"title": "太阳的背面-05", "pageid": 84871, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%83%8C%E9%9D%A2-04\" title=\"太阳的背面-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">太阳的背面-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%AA%E9%98%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%83%8C%E9%9D%A2-06\" title=\"太阳的背面-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">太阳的背面</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.AE.80.E6.98.93.E9.80.9A.E8.AE.AF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"简易通讯\">简易通讯</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 简易通讯</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Phone Call</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2350105</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_fangjian\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_fangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>电话猝不及防地响起了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"at_dianhuatexie\"><img alt=\"at_dianhuatexie\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png/600px-Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png/900px-Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png/1200px-Cg-at_dianhuatexie.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>喂？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>……夏洛特，你看到基金会最新的评议结果了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她语气里的小心翼翼令女巫感到厌烦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>你有什么话，可以直接说出来，我没有你们想象的那么脆弱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310422.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-310422.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310422.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310422.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-310422.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310422.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/HeadIconSmall-310422.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310422.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>我最恨你们这种弯弯绕绕的样子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>电话彼端的人长长地叹了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>夏洛特，也许你……没有办法去乌卢鲁了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>绝不可能。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>经过基金会的评议，他们还是认为……这是不公平的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-310414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-310414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-310414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>太荒唐了，我是一个残疾人，为什么会不公平？难道那些选手会害怕从一个瘸子身上占到便宜吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310413.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-310413.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310413.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310413.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-310413.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310413.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-310413.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310413.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>如果她们害怕和一个瘸子竞争，那么这块金牌也没有被争夺的必要了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>……不。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她艰难地说出了接下来的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>当然，倘若只以履历评判，不会有人比你更有资格参与这个比赛了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>但组委会一致认为，如果让你和那些健全的运动员去竞争……这对你是不公平的，夏洛特。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-310414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-310414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-310414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>所以——他们体现所谓“公平”的方式，就是剥夺这个残疾人的参赛资格吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>我还能站起来——他们凭什么剥夺我的运动员身份？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310413.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-310413.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310413.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310413.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-310413.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310413.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-310413.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310413.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>……我还记得那句话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她露出了一抹惯常的讥笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310413.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-310413.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310413.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310413.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-310413.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310413.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-310413.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310413.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>“自由祭祀始终还是一个神秘学家的项目，如果只有技术分，那她为什么不去参加别的运动会呢？那儿才是技术分决定一切的地方。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-310414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-310414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-310414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>他们既然看不起技术分，怎么又能用这个理由将我拒之门外？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几乎等同于一个世纪一样漫长的死寂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>抱歉，夏洛特……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-310414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-310414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-310414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>该死的……你为什么要道歉！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>……我会再次帮助你申报决赛的名额，尽我最大的努力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-310414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-310414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-310414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>——我不是废物！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女巫猝不及防地提高了音调。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-310414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-310414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-310414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>我会自己解决这些事情！用不着你的帮忙，收起你那泛滥的怜悯心吧！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310414.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-310414.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310414.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310414.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-310414.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310414.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-310414.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310414.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>你希望我感谢你吗？你要我如何感激这份恩惠呢？……别忘了，当年拿到金牌的人是我，而你只是个亚军！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628620.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628620.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"24\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-628620.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628620.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"131\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>……抱歉，夏洛特。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_fangjian\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_fangjian\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_fangjian.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>电话被挂断了，听筒中传来了短促的忙音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女巫紧紧地捏着话筒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>滚开！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她重重地扔出了电话机，然后将桌子上所有的东西全扫到了地上，物品碰撞，发出杂乱的响声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>为什么？凭什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>东西落地的声音在不断响起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>该死的——该死的——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无论她发出多大的声响，都不会有人回答她的问题。<br />四周的居民忌惮于女巫的名声，早已学会对各种异响不闻不问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女巫也只能以制造噪音的方式施展她的权能——直到她触摸到了一个小小的匣子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她意识到了这是什么，颤抖着打开了它。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>奖牌安静地躺在绒布上，与匣子同样陈旧。它的一侧似乎受到过撞击，有一个小小的凹痕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-310412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-310412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/HeadIconSmall-310412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她记得的，她应当记得的。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "太阳的背面-05"}}